  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p>Using given information&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;, we can write&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>"
